fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsrc.html#GstAppSrcEnoughDataCallback","fragment":"\n\tGstAppSrcEnoughDataCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSrcEnoughDataCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSrcEnoughDataCallback\n\nCalled when appsrc has enough data. It is recommended that the application\nstops calling push-buffer until the need_data callback is emitted again to\navoid excessive buffer queueing.\nParameters:\na GstAppSrc\ncallback user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when appsrc has enough data. It is recommended that the application\nstops calling push-buffer until the need_data callback is emitted again to\navoid excessive buffer queueing.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSrc\ncallback user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when appsrc has enough data. It is recommended that the application\nstops calling push-buffer until the need_data callback is emitted again to\navoid excessive buffer queueing.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSrc\ncallback user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});